{"type":"FeatureCollection","municipality_code":"01644","pref":"北海道","city":"池田町","display_comment":"池田町には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「慈教寺」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、その土地の暮らしや水との関わりを伝える歴史案内板が見つかるかもしれません。 ゆかりの人物では丸谷金保や大和田夏希に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「十日川5遺跡出土遺物」や「林務署遺跡出土遺物」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","layer_counts":{"public_facilities":21,"cultural_facilities":12,"parks_playgrounds":9},"total_features":42,"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"昭栄地区コミュニティセンター","category":"public","address":"池田町昭栄112","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"01644","municipality_pref":"北海道","municipality_name":"池田町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[143.47184,42.888101]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"旭町３町内会館","category":"public","address":"池田町旭町3-17","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"01644","municipality_pref":"北海道","municipality_name":"池田町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[143.451872129711,42.9309092215024]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"労働福祉会館","category":"public","address":"池田町旭町1-3-1","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"01644","municipality_pref":"北海道","municipality_name":"池田町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[143.452374995769,42.9264911295956]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"高島支所","category":"public","address":"池田町字高島39-4","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"01644","municipality_pref":"北海道","municipality_name":"池田町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[143.458416668,43.0282743478]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":